{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00426",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 4.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 9.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.61,
      "end_seconds": 14.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a red swollen area on my leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.28,
      "end_seconds": 19.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "And when did that start? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.15,
      "end_seconds": 23.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.69,
      "end_seconds": 31.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.28,
      "end_seconds": 37.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "It happens all the time. Only elevating the leg, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.67,
      "end_seconds": 40.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Has there been a fever too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.13,
      "end_seconds": 46.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. With fever, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.3,
      "end_seconds": 51.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Okay, has there been pain in that area too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.72,
      "end_seconds": 57.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Yeah. Three days, I'd say. About pain in that area, it's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.69,
      "end_seconds": 64.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Have you had a red swollen area on your leg before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.84,
      "end_seconds": 68.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.1,
      "end_seconds": 74.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Have you had any numbness around it, vomiting, shortness of breath or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.18,
      "end_seconds": 80.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "No, no numbness around it, vomiting, shortness of breath or pus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.95,
      "end_seconds": 84.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.52,
      "end_seconds": 87.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Not at all, no calf pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.43,
      "end_seconds": 91.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.83,
      "end_seconds": 106.62,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I'm on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.78,
      "end_seconds": 110.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.26,
      "end_seconds": 115.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, I had my thyroid operated on, a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.27,
      "end_seconds": 118.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.17,
      "end_seconds": 119.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.72,
      "end_seconds": 137.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.08,
      "end_seconds": 140.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.42,
      "end_seconds": 149.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.68,
      "end_seconds": 161.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Diabetes, for nearly five years. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. My family kept telling me to get it checked. Yes, anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.63,
      "end_seconds": 171.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Okay, diabetes, that's already on your record. Good to know. Okay, anxiety, that's already on your record. Good to know. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.64,
      "end_seconds": 187.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.39,
      "end_seconds": 216.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.91,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 38.7, heart rate 99, oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And BP is 115 over 76. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.95,
      "end_seconds": 218.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.06,
      "end_seconds": 223.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Right, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.75,
      "end_seconds": 226.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.29,
      "end_seconds": 241.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.47,
      "end_seconds": 243.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.47,
      "end_seconds": 263.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "The skin on the lower leg is red, warm and swollen, about the size of my palm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.54,
      "end_seconds": 287.16,
      "duration_seconds": 19.62,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like cellulitis. It could also be a deep vein clot, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.91,
      "end_seconds": 290.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.91,
      "end_seconds": 308.19,
      "duration_seconds": 17.28,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like cellulitis, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red swollen area on your leg for ten days, and no numbness around it or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.54,
      "end_seconds": 311.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.73,
      "end_seconds": 318.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.48,
      "end_seconds": 324.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.55,
      "end_seconds": 350.84,
      "duration_seconds": 25.29,
      "text": "I'm going to order a wound swab, for infected wound. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll start you on clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. That should help with skin infection. Keep the leg raised on a pillow when you're sitting. Mark the edge of the redness with a pen so we can see whether it spreads."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.2,
      "end_seconds": 362.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. If the redness spreads or the fever gets higher, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.62,
      "end_seconds": 365.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, um, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.61,
      "end_seconds": 376.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two days. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.64,
      "end_seconds": 385.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "So, I take the clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.63,
      "end_seconds": 392.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.03,
      "end_seconds": 394.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}